# Atlas Core Component Tokens Specification & Implementation
**Author:** Echo Hale  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 21:30  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Standardized, refactored W3C DTCG-compliant component token definitions for Atlas Core, harmonizing SaaS digital surfaces and face-to-face service interfaces per the design rules extracted from Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "version": "2.4.0",
    "author": "Echo Hale <design-core@itskokos.internal>",
    "refactorIteration": 4,
    "sourceCompliance": {
      "document": "Company Document",
      "usage": "Applied foundational typography scale, core brand palette ratios, and dual-surface contrast requirements (SaaS dashboard vs. on-site service tablets) detailed in Company Document to establish semantic component token bindings."
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}", "$type": "color" },
          "hover": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.700}", "$type": "color" },
          "active": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.800}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "padding": {
          "x": { "$value": "{spacing.md}", "$type": "dimension" },
          "y": { "$value": "{spacing.sm}", "$type": "dimension" }
        },
        "radius": { "$value": "{radius.sm}", "$type": "dimension" }
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "border": {
        "color": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.neutral.300}", "$type": "color" },
          "focus": { "$value": "{color.brand.accent.500}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "width": { "$value": "1px", "$type": "dimension" }
      },
      "typography": { "$value": "{typography.body.md}", "$type": "typography" }
    }
  }
}
```